The plate is a paper plate, likely about 23 cm across (it spans roughly 260 px in the image). The apple spans about 130 px, which works out to roughly 11.5 cm across the top view. Allowing for that and the apple's height, that is a fairly large apple, perhaps 8 cm in diameter. A 7.5–8 cm apple weighs about 200 g.

At about 0.52 kcal/g, 200 g of apple comes to roughly 104 kcal. I'll round to 105 kcal.

